 plugins/platforms/feishu/adapter.py           |  8 +--
 .../platforms/feishu/feishu_topic_follow.py   | 17 +++++
 tests/gateway/test_feishu_topic_follow.py     | 60 +++++++++++++++++
 .../test_stream_consumer_thread_routing.py    | 67 -------------------
 5 files changed, 83 insertions(+), 73 deletions(-)

